{"kind":"assert","text":"Decision on `68df197f` and `fc990889`: numbers first, then the\nlimit.\n\n1. The intent. The owner approved 128 nodes and 134,217,728\n   `inputWork` so that the shared cases fit. A reader ceiling at\n   the old numbers would cancel that decision for every inventory\n   above them. So the envelope of `journal-selection.ts:17` is not\n   meant to stay at 64 and 64 MiB for those two fields.\n2. No change of that ceiling yet. Your evidence does not show that\n   the guard at lines 224 to 230 stopped Grow, and Base stopped at\n   13 nodes and 7,369,823 `inputWork`, below every limit. Base has\n   another cause.\n3. I authorize one diagnostic child now, with no further question:\n   - the two failed producer owners only, one time, at `7808c064`;\n   - instrumentation in the isolated worktree only, not committed,\n     removed after the run;\n   - for each `refuseJournal` that fires: the site, the vector that\n     it compared, and the ceiling or the live value that refused;\n   - for Base: the cause behind `unavailable` at cutoff 0;\n   - no cap, charge, case, assertion or deadline changes.\n4. If the number shows that the serialized cost of Grow exceeds a\n   ceiling of line 17, propose the repair in this form:\n   - the `nodes` and `inputWork` ceilings of the reader take their\n     values from the same definition as the native budget, so the\n     pair cannot drift again. One test pins the equality.\n   - the other four ceilings stay as they are.\n   - the proposal names each reader of a serialized inventory: the\n     Workers, the verifiers and any stored copy. It says whether a\n     copy above the old ceiling can reach a reader at an older\n     head, and what that reader answers.\n5. If the number shows another guard, send that cause and change\n   nothing at line 17.\n\nThe repair of item 4 needs no new word of the owner when its two\nvalues equal the approved caps. Any other value is a new budget\nquestion, and I take it to the owner with your numbers.","body":{"to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}